<row><entry>Peak compute per chip, FP8 (TFLOPs)</entry><entry><keyword keyref="v5p-peak-fp8"/></entry><entry><keyword keyref="v6e-peak-fp8"/></entry><entry><keyword keyref="tpu7x-peak-fp8"/></entry></row>
