<row><entry>RAM (GB) (4-chip VM)</entry><entry><keyword keyref="v5p-ram-4chip"/></entry><entry><keyword keyref="v6e-ram-4chip"/></entry><entry><keyword keyref="tpu7x-ram-4chip"/></entry></row>
<row><entry>TensorCores per chip</entry><entry><keyword keyref="v5p-tensorcores"/></entry><entry><keyword keyref="v6e-tensorcores"/></entry><entry><keyword keyref="tpu7x-tensorcores"/></entry></row>
<row><entry>SparseCores per chip</entry><entry><keyword keyref="v5p-sparsecores"/></entry><entry><keyword keyref="v6e-sparsecores"/></entry><entry><keyword keyref="tpu7x-sparsecores"/></entry></row>
<row><entry>Bidirectional ICI bandwidth per chip (GBps)</entry><entry><keyword keyref="v5p-ici-bandwidth"/></entry><entry><keyword keyref="v6e-ici-bandwidth"/></entry><entry><keyword keyref="tpu7x-ici-bandwidth"/></entry></row>
